        "longTitle": "6. SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED INFECTIONS",
        "text": "6. SEXUALLY TRANSMITTED INFECTIONS\nGENERAL NOTES\nURETHRAL DISCHARGE IN MEN\nVAGINAL DISCHARGE IN WOMEN\nANAL AND RECTAL INFECTIONS\nGENITAL ULCERS IN MEN & WOMEN (+/-BUBOES)\nGRANULATING ULCERS WITHOUT BUBOES\nBUBOES WITHOUT ULCERS\nACUTE EPIDIDYMO-ORCHITIS\nSYPHILIS\nGENITAL WARTS (CONDYLOMATA ACUMINATE)\nMOLLUSCUM CONTAGIOSUM\nPEDICULOSIS PUBIS (PUBIC LICE)\nOPHTHALMIA NEONATORUM"
