        "text": "13. TROPICAL DISEASES\nANTHRAX (CUTANEOUS)\nTICK TYPHUS (AFRICAN)\nRABIES\nBILHARZIA (SCHISTOSOMA MANSONI & HAEMATOBIUM)\nHELMINTHIASIS\nPLAGUE (BUBONIC)\nLEPROSY\nNOTIFIABLE DISEASES"
