        "shortTitle": "Section 28",
        "longTitle": "Massive intractable ascites",
        "text": "Resistant patients:\nMedicine\nCodes\nAdult dose\nFrequency\nDuration\nspironolactone po\nB\nV\n50-400mg\nonce a day\nreview\nNote: Do not give potassium supplements with these diuretics.\n\nOnly if above fail, add:\nMedicine\nCodes\nAdult dose\nFrequency\nDuration\nfrusemide po\nB\nV\nstart at 40mg\nonce a day\nincrease gradually\nStop if encephalopathy or uraemia develop.\nMassive intractable ascites\nConsider possible decompensation of liver function or development of hepatoma\nor SBP. Perform large volume paracentesis."
