        "text": "20. DIABETES, ENDOCRINOLOGY AND\nMETABOLISM\nDIABETES MELLITUS\nTYPES OF INSULIN\nORAL ANTI-DIABETIC AGENTS\nDIABETIC DIET\nSPECIAL PROBLEMS IN DIABETICS\nSURGERY\nHYPERGLYCAEMIC COMA & PRE-COMA (ADULTS)\nHYPERGLYCAEMIC COMA AND PRE-COMA (CHILDREN)\nTHYROID DISEASE\nGOITRE\nHYPERTHYROIDISM\nHYPOADRENALISM"
